/-! # P4-W2 (session 7, step 3g (main dispatch)): the per-summand dispatch (generated by `uni/scratch8/gen_disp.py`)

`disp_*`: for each non-joint summand of a bundle (the pieces A1, A2, KQ, KT in case A and their case-M mirrors, and the ten remainder shapes), the `PieceRep` of
the summand `bundlePtG caseA S bs₁ bs₂ rA rB RQ RT t₀ s₁ t₁ (k + e_x r) (k + e_y r) c` from the order facts and the open windows of the three clocks, together with
the product bound `bK * bL ≤ Kall d K₀ · ofReal (size)` (`Src.szQ`, `Src.szT`, `CRq`, `CRt`) and the factor `FacOK` (`1`, or `‖r‖` for the kind-1 pieces KQ, KT). -/

@[expose] public section
